845
00:35:32.790 --> 00:35:35.050
But they would love Dwight's gym.

846
00:35:35.250 --> 00:35:35.570
They would.

847
00:35:35.770 --> 00:35:36.410
They would be all over—

848
00:35:36.410 --> 00:35:37.170
They'd be like, this is amazing.

849
00:35:37.170 --> 00:35:38.670
This is literally how they train.

850
00:35:39.310 --> 00:35:40.590
Daryl's not loving it.

851
00:35:40.730 --> 00:35:42.270
No, he wants a real gym.

852
00:35:42.830 --> 00:35:45.610
This whole gym storyline was so much bigger.

853
00:35:45.750 --> 00:35:48.270
Almost all the deleted scenes are gym storylines.

854
00:35:48.770 --> 00:35:49.450
Oh, wow.

855
00:35:49.610 --> 00:35:49.790
Mm-hmm.

856
00:35:49.850 --> 00:35:50.850
Not gym helper.

857
00:35:51.010 --> 00:35:51.710
Not gym helper.

858
00:35:51.870 --> 00:35:52.510
Gym muscles.

859
00:35:52.770 --> 00:35:53.310
Gym muscles.

860
00:35:54.230 --> 00:35:55.790
But I'll share more of those later.

861
00:35:56.090 --> 00:35:59.970
Next up, we have one of my favorite scenes in the episode, which is when Andy meets with Mr.

862
