927
00:38:56.210 --> 00:38:56.510
Yeah.

928
00:38:56.930 --> 00:38:58.230
I like that phrase.

929
00:38:58.530 --> 00:38:59.950
I want to start using that.

930
00:39:00.210 --> 00:39:05.150
Like, if Lee makes plans and I don't want to do them, I'm going to say, undo this.

931
00:39:05.330 --> 00:39:06.030
Undo this.

932
00:39:06.190 --> 00:39:07.490
I need you to undo this.

933
00:39:07.530 --> 00:39:07.770
Yeah.

934
00:39:08.170 --> 00:39:14.210
It's like the line that really stuck with me in Succession when he goes, you are not serious people.

935
00:39:14.430 --> 00:39:14.870
Yes.

