Why is Toby's chair so low and his desk so high?

1009
00:42:52.950 --> 00:42:54.430
Oh, my gosh, Angela.

1010
00:42:54.770 --> 00:42:55.870
His desk?

1011
00:42:56.070 --> 00:42:58.070
It's in his armpit.

1012
00:42:58.670 --> 00:43:00.090
I took pictures.

1013
00:43:00.350 --> 00:43:00.910
Let me see.

1014
00:43:00.990 --> 00:43:01.870
I'm putting on my glasses.

1015
00:43:02.730 --> 00:43:03.850
Swipe to look.

1016
00:43:03.970 --> 00:43:05.110
That is a far away.

1017
00:43:05.230 --> 00:43:06.390
And then I did a close-up.

1018
00:43:07.190 --> 00:43:07.750
What?

1019
00:43:07.990 --> 00:43:09.310
Who sits like that?

1020
00:43:09.510 --> 00:43:10.390
You know what?

1021
00:43:10.490 --> 00:43:14.190
I bet he got the crap chair that we kept passing around.

1022
00:43:14.190 --> 00:43:14.570
Remember?

1023
00:43:14.830 --> 00:43:16.970
Sometimes you would come on set and you'd be like,

1024
00:43:17.050 --> 00:43:19.010
Who the heck put the crap chair?

1025
00:43:19.110 --> 00:43:20.130
The one that wouldn't go up and down.

1026
00:43:20.130 --> 00:43:21.230
It wouldn't go up and down.

1027
00:43:21.230 --> 00:43:24.350
And we kept moving it back to the annex or moving it somewhere else.

