made, like, next week, and he had to leave the show.

1369
00:56:44.760 --> 00:56:50.400
So he was really bummed, but he was also super happy that he got to direct this episode before

1370
00:56:50.400 --> 00:56:51.040
he left.

1371
00:56:51.420 --> 00:56:51.860
Wow.

1372
00:56:52.140 --> 00:56:53.120
But he's not sure.

1373
00:56:53.340 --> 00:56:57.540
He said, yes, there were some plans to maybe keep Maura in the mix.

1374
00:56:57.620 --> 00:56:58.460
Yeah, I kind of remember that.

1375
00:56:58.460 --> 00:56:59.520
He doesn't know what happened.

1376
00:56:59.520 --> 00:57:03.860
I sort of remember that, Scuttle, but we all loved working with her, and she was so great

1377
00:57:03.860 --> 00:57:07.820
in the episode, and I remember after this episode aired, everyone being like, ooh.

1378
00:57:08.840 --> 00:57:12.040
So I'm sad we didn't get to see a date between those two.

1379
00:57:12.260 --> 00:57:15.520
Well, Andy has been seeing someone now for 31 dates.

1380
00:57:15.700 --> 00:57:15.900
Yeah.

1381
00:57:16.040 --> 00:57:17.380
We never meet that person either.

1382
00:57:17.580 --> 00:57:17.920
Nope.

1383
00:57:19.920 --> 00:57:22.920
Well, that is Mrs. California, everybody.

1384
00:57:23.180 --> 00:57:27.660
A big thank you to Steve Burgess and Charlie Grandy and all of you for sending in your questions.

1385
00:57:27.960 --> 00:57:30.240
Seriously, your questions are so good.

1386
00:57:30.420 --> 00:57:32.480
Your background catches are amazing.

1387
00:57:32.480 --> 00:57:37.060
I feel like we dig into the episode, and then you guys will write in and say something,

1388
00:57:37.160 --> 00:57:38.700
